#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/llms-txt.rst:2
msgid "``llms.txt`` support"
msgstr "``llms.txt`` 支持"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/llms-txt.rst:4
msgid ""
"The `llms.txt`_ file is a standard for providing LLM-friendly content to AI "
"assistants and other language models. It allows you to provide a custom file"
" that:"
msgstr "`llms.txt`_ 文件是为 AI 助手和其他语言模型提供 LLM 友好内容的标准。它让你提供一个自定义文件，具备以下作用："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/llms-txt.rst:7
msgid "Gives AI models structured information about your documentation"
msgstr "向 AI 模型提供关于你文档的结构化信息"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/llms-txt.rst:8
msgid "Helps AI understand your project's structure and content"
msgstr "帮助 AI 理解你的项目结构和内容"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/llms-txt.rst:9
msgid "Provides a more focused view of your documentation for AI consumption"
msgstr "为 AI 消费提供更聚焦的文档视图"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/llms-txt.rst:11
msgid ""
"Read the Docs supports serving custom ``llms.txt`` files from your "
"documentation."
msgstr "Read the Docs 支持从你的文档中提供自定义 ``llms.txt`` 文件。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/llms-txt.rst:14
msgid "How it works"
msgstr "工作原理"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/llms-txt.rst:16
msgid ""
"The ``llms.txt`` file will be served from the **default version** of your "
"project at ``https://your-project.readthedocs.io/llms.txt``. This is because"
" the ``llms.txt`` file is served at the top-level of your domain, so we must"
" choose a version to find the file in. The **default version** is the best "
"place to look for it."
msgstr ""
"``llms.txt`` 文件将从项目的**默认版本** 在 ``https://your-"
"project.readthedocs.io/llms.txt`` 提供。因为 ``llms.txt`` "
"在域名顶层提供服务，我们必须选择某个版本来查找该文件，** 默认版本** 是最合适的位置。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/llms-txt.rst:21
msgid ""
"If you also provide a ``llms-full.txt`` file, Read the Docs will serve it "
"from ``https://your-project.readthedocs.io/llms-full.txt`` using the same "
"rules."
msgstr ""
"若你还提供 ``llms-full.txt`` 文件，Read the Docs 将按相同规则从 ``https://your-"
"project.readthedocs.io/llms-full.txt`` 提供它。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/llms-txt.rst:24
msgid "To use this feature:"
msgstr "使用此功能："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/llms-txt.rst:26
msgid "Create a ``llms.txt`` file in your documentation source"
msgstr "在文档源中创建 ``llms.txt`` 文件"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/llms-txt.rst:27
msgid "Configure your documentation tool to include it in the build output"
msgstr "配置文档工具将其包含进构建输出"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/llms-txt.rst:28
msgid "Read the Docs will automatically serve it at the root of your domain"
msgstr "Read the Docs 会自动在域名根目录提供它"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/llms-txt.rst:32
msgid "The ``llms.txt`` file will only be served if:"
msgstr "只有满足以下条件时才会提供 ``llms.txt`` 文件："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/llms-txt.rst:34
msgid "Your default version is **active**"
msgstr "默认版本处于**活跃** 状态"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/llms-txt.rst:35
msgid "Your default version has been **built**"
msgstr "默认版本已被**构建**"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/llms-txt.rst:36
msgid "The ``llms.txt`` file exists in your build output"
msgstr "``llms.txt`` 文件存在于构建输出中"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/llms-txt.rst:39
msgid "Tool integration"
msgstr "工具集成"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/llms-txt.rst:41
msgid ""
"Documentation tools will have different ways of generating a ``llms.txt`` "
"file. We have examples for some of the most popular tools below."
msgstr "不同文档工具生成 ``llms.txt`` 的方式各不相同。下面给出一些最常用工具的示例。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/llms-txt.rst:46
msgid "Sphinx"
msgstr "Sphinx"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/llms-txt.rst:48
msgid ""
"Sphinx uses the `html_extra_path`_ configuration value to add static files "
"to its final HTML output. You need to create a ``llms.txt`` file and put it "
"under the path defined in ``html_extra_path``."
msgstr ""
"Sphinx 使用 `html_extra_path`_ 配置值将静态文件加入最终 HTML 输出。你需要创建 ``llms.txt`` 文件并放到 "
"``html_extra_path`` 定义的路径下。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/llms-txt.rst:51
msgid ""
"You can also use the `sphinx-llm`_ extension to automatically generate an "
"``llms.txt`` file from your documentation."
msgstr "你也可以使用 `sphinx-llm`_ 扩展从文档自动生成 ``llms.txt`` 文件。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/llms-txt.rst:53
msgid "MkDocs"
msgstr "MkDocs"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/llms-txt.rst:55
msgid ""
"MkDocs needs the ``llms.txt`` to be at the directory defined by the "
"`docs_dir`_ configuration value."
msgstr "MkDocs 要求 ``llms.txt`` 位于 `docs_dir`_ 配置值定义的目录中。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/llms-txt.rst:57
msgid ""
"You can also use the `mkdocs-llmstxt`_ plugin to automatically generate an "
"``llms.txt`` file from your documentation."
msgstr "你也可以使用 `mkdocs-llmstxt`_ 插件从文档自动生成 ``llms.txt`` 文件。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/llms-txt.rst:60
msgid "Alternative: Using redirects"
msgstr "替代方案：使用重定向"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/llms-txt.rst:62
msgid ""
"If you want to serve your ``llms.txt`` file from a versioned path (like "
"``/en/latest/llms.txt``), you can create an :doc:`exact redirect "
"</guides/redirects>` from ``/llms.txt`` to ``/en/latest/llms.txt``. This "
"gives you more control over which version serves the file."
msgstr ""
"若希望从带版本的路径（如 ``/en/latest/llms.txt`` ）提供 ``llms.txt`` 文件，可创建从 ``/llms.txt`` "
"到 ``/en/latest/llms.txt`` 的 :doc:`精确重定向 </guides/redirects>` "
"。这让你更能控制由哪个版本提供该文件。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/llms-txt.rst:74
msgid ":doc:`/guides/redirects`"
msgstr ":doc:`/guides/redirects`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/llms-txt.rst:76
msgid ":doc:`/reference/markdown-for-agents`"
msgstr ":doc:`/reference/markdown-for-agents`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/reference/llms-txt.rst:77
msgid ""
"Read the Docs also serves a Markdown version of your documentation pages to "
"AI agents that request it, via content negotiation."
msgstr "Read the Docs 还通过内容协商向请求的 AI 智能体提供文档页面的 Markdown 版本。"

